WEBVTT

00:02.960 --> 00:05.670
<b>THE ELUSIVE
 SAMURAI</b>

01:25.290 --> 01:29.960
<b>THE ELUSIVE
 SAMURAI</b>

01:54.730 --> 01:55.740
<b>Lord Kunitoki.</b>

01:57.320 --> 01:58.570
<b>It's me, Muneshige.</b>

01:59.110 --> 02:01.140
<b>TOKIYUKI AND KUNITOKI'S UNCLE</b>

02:00.240 --> 02:01.070
<b>Uncle…</b>

02:01.660 --> 02:03.540
<b>What's the state of Kamakura?</b>

02:03.620 --> 02:04.830
<b>And what about Tokiyuki?</b>

02:04.910 --> 02:08.040
<b>I hear Lord Yorishige Suwa 
will help Tokiyuki escape.</b>

02:08.120 --> 02:10.830
<b>As for us, let's hurry and leave 
at the first light of day.</b>

02:14.550 --> 02:16.550
<b>-Uncle…
-Don't worry.</b>

02:16.630 --> 02:19.590
<b>The lower-ranked samurai 
shouldn't know our faces.</b>

02:20.180 --> 02:21.590
<b>I'll deceive them somehow.</b>

02:21.680 --> 02:22.850
<b>You stay hidden.</b>

02:22.930 --> 02:24.260
<b>That's too dangerous!</b>

02:24.350 --> 02:28.690
<b>Lord Takatoki entrusted me with 
you, his precious Hojo child.</b>

02:29.190 --> 02:31.600
<b>I will protect you even if 
I must lay down my life.</b>

02:32.190 --> 02:33.480
<b>Uncle…</b>

02:33.570 --> 02:36.110
<b>Yes, and above all,</b>

02:36.610 --> 02:39.360
<b>you are my precious little sister's child.</b>

02:40.360 --> 02:43.370
<b>If I fail, please run.</b>

02:43.870 --> 02:45.290
<b>Uncle!</b>

02:51.170 --> 02:52.170
<b>What?</b>

02:58.920 --> 02:59.920
<b>Uncle.</b>

03:01.090 --> 03:02.090
<b>Uncle!</b>

03:02.800 --> 03:04.720
<b>Uncle!</b>

03:13.440 --> 03:14.480
<b>Father!</b>

03:14.560 --> 03:15.730
<b>Everyone!</b>

03:19.110 --> 03:21.740
<b>Lord Tokiyuki. Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

03:21.820 --> 03:23.280
<b>Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

03:24.070 --> 03:26.370
<b>Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

03:31.210 --> 03:32.790
<b>Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

03:33.790 --> 03:36.590
<b>Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

03:36.670 --> 03:39.130
<b>Your face when you're asleep is so sweet.</b>

03:39.210 --> 03:40.920
<b>I could just eat you up.</b>

03:41.010 --> 03:45.510
<b>I know how much you like to 
watch children sleep, Father,</b>

03:46.010 --> 03:48.850
<b>-but Lord Tokiyuki is having a nightmare.
-There we go.</b>

03:48.930 --> 03:50.100
<b>Let's see!</b>

03:50.180 --> 03:52.580
<b>I think a peck on the cheek wouldn't hurt.</b>

03:51.690 --> 03:52.520
<b>GLARE</b>

03:57.730 --> 03:59.570
<b>What are you doing? What is wrong with you?</b>

04:00.070 --> 04:03.910
<b>Lord Tokiyuki, I expected as 
much from your escaping prowess.</b>

04:03.990 --> 04:07.950
<b>In the future, we call 
that a "Wake-up Prank."</b>

04:08.030 --> 04:09.290
<b>PRANK A SUCCESS!!!</b>

04:09.370 --> 04:10.200
<b>I don't care!</b>

04:10.790 --> 04:12.790
<b>This isn't the time to be 
playing around, Mr. Yorishige!</b>

04:12.870 --> 04:15.790
<b>You said we could hide in your territory,</b>

04:15.880 --> 04:19.250
<b>but we've just been taking cover 
in Kamakura for several days!</b>

04:19.960 --> 04:25.550
<b>That's because the exit of Kamakura
 is more tightly guarded than I thought.</b>

04:26.760 --> 04:30.810
<b>We have to be patient until 
their watch eases up.</b>

04:32.730 --> 04:33.890
<b>The watch, huh?</b>

04:36.310 --> 04:39.440
<b><i>I recognize those standards…</i></b>

04:40.190 --> 04:43.990
<b><i>But the samurai under those banners, who 
had sworn allegiance to the Shogunate,</i></b>

04:44.070 --> 04:46.450
<b><i>betrayed us, just like that, 
and destroyed Kamakura.</i></b>

04:47.030 --> 04:50.120
<b><i>All under Lord Takauji's orders…</i></b>

04:50.740 --> 04:55.040
<b><i>To think beneath that kind smile of his, 
he was plotting such traitorous plans</i></b>

04:55.120 --> 04:56.620
<b><i>to destroy the Shogunate.</i></b>

04:59.170 --> 05:01.050
<b>Don't worry, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

05:01.710 --> 05:03.380
<b>In these clothes, we can trick them.</b>

05:03.470 --> 05:06.800
<b>We look like Shinto priests 
whose shrine was burned.</b>

05:14.640 --> 05:15.850
<b>Mr. Yorishige.</b>

05:15.940 --> 05:19.900
<b>You told me, "Take back your country 
by winning this game of tag</b>

05:20.440 --> 05:23.360
<b>with your excellent ability to run away."</b>

05:23.940 --> 05:26.860
<b>But samurai fight looking straight on.</b>

05:26.950 --> 05:29.950
<b>I've never heard of a samurai taking 
a country through a game of tag.</b>

05:30.450 --> 05:33.080
<b>You really think I can 
take back this country?</b>

05:33.160 --> 05:35.410
<b>That I can avenge everyone I loved?</b>

05:35.500 --> 05:37.120
<b>-Of course!
-You scared me!</b>

05:37.620 --> 05:44.170
<b>Through my divine eye, I see 
a future where you are a hero.</b>

05:45.670 --> 05:50.640
<b>So, Lord Tokiyuki, bear this 
burden for a little while longer.</b>

05:51.760 --> 05:52.760
<b>For now…</b>

05:53.970 --> 05:55.020
<b>FUTURISTIC GAME OF DICE</b>

05:54.250 --> 05:56.960
<b>let's play a game of dice while we wait!</b>

05:57.560 --> 05:59.940
<b>Shizuku, prepare the dice and game pieces!</b>

06:00.020 --> 06:01.520
<b>Yes, Father.</b>

06:01.610 --> 06:03.270
<b>I've never seen this game of dice.</b>

06:03.360 --> 06:05.150
<b>What's a God of Poverty?</b>

06:05.240 --> 06:08.240
<b>You'll get to learn when you play.</b>

06:08.740 --> 06:11.160
<b>Come on, Lord Tokiyuki. Join us.</b>

06:15.160 --> 06:16.160
<b>Huh?</b>

06:18.000 --> 06:20.420
<b><i>I knew I couldn't trust those two.</i></b>

06:21.380 --> 06:24.670
<b><i>I have to find who remains 
of the Shogunate myself.</i></b>

06:38.890 --> 06:42.520
<b>Man, there's nothing good here.</b>

06:42.610 --> 06:44.820
<b>One man's trash is another man's trash.</b>

06:45.440 --> 06:48.610
<b>You know, I saw that execution.</b>

06:48.700 --> 06:54.280
<b>Oh, yeah, was it Lord Kunitoki Hojo?</b>

06:56.910 --> 06:59.160
<b>Oh, yeah. The head came clean off.</b>

06:59.790 --> 07:01.330
<b>You have strange taste.</b>

07:02.500 --> 07:03.750
<b>You're lying!</b>

07:04.500 --> 07:05.880
<b>Huh?</b>

07:06.800 --> 07:08.420
<b>Who are you?</b>

07:09.010 --> 07:10.130
<b>There's no way!</b>

07:10.220 --> 07:12.760
<b>My brother… He can't be!</b>

07:12.840 --> 07:14.220
<b>Your brother?</b>

07:14.300 --> 07:15.560
<b>What do you mean your brother?</b>

07:15.640 --> 07:17.390
<b>You're talking about Lord Kunitoki?</b>

07:18.020 --> 07:19.980
<b>Whose kid are you?</b>

07:20.060 --> 07:21.810
<b>I-</b>

07:24.110 --> 07:27.280
<b>This boy is an apprentice at my shrine.</b>

07:27.780 --> 07:30.740
<b>The Hojo family had favored us,</b>

07:30.820 --> 07:33.700
<b>so he can get worked up 
hearing Lord Kunitoki's name.</b>

07:34.320 --> 07:35.330
<b>Right?</b>

07:36.700 --> 07:38.080
<b>Yes.</b>

07:40.500 --> 07:44.790
<b>What exactly happened to Lord Kunitoki?</b>

07:45.670 --> 07:50.670
<b>You know, he was entrusted to 
his uncle, Muneshige Godaiin.</b>

07:51.220 --> 07:57.060
<b>He was hiding him, but then, he ratted 
Kunitoki's hiding spot out to Nitta's men.</b>

07:57.640 --> 07:59.520
<b>AWARD FOR BIGGEST TYRANT 1333
 GODAIIN</b>

07:58.220 --> 08:01.060
<b><i>Having risen to power through his nephew,</i></b>

08:01.140 --> 08:03.230
<b><i>Muneshige Godaiin sold 
his own flesh and blood,</i></b>

08:03.310 --> 08:07.020
<b><i>the regent's nine-year-old son, to 
the enemy in the blink of an eye.</i></b>

08:07.110 --> 08:12.610
<b><i>The man went on to become one of the most 
brutal warlords in Japanese history.</i></b>

08:14.110 --> 08:16.490
<b>Lord Kunitoki was a Hojo child.</b>

08:17.240 --> 08:19.540
<b>Beheading was his sentence.</b>

08:20.200 --> 08:21.370
<b>I saw it happen earlier.</b>

08:22.330 --> 08:25.130
<b>It was a pitiful death.</b>

08:28.000 --> 08:29.300
<b>Lord Tokiyuki?</b>

08:35.720 --> 08:39.640
<b><i>Betrayal. Betrayal. Betrayal.</i></b>

08:41.140 --> 08:42.810
<b><i>I can't make sense of it.</i></b>

08:46.730 --> 08:49.900
<b><i>The Ashikaga family who served 
us for generations betrayed us.</i></b>

08:49.980 --> 08:52.990
<b><i>Our samurai retainers betrayed us.</i></b>

08:53.530 --> 08:55.030
<b><i>And now my own uncle betrayed us.</i></b>

08:55.990 --> 08:58.990
<b><i>There's not one person I can trust.</i></b>

09:02.080 --> 09:03.370
<b><i>Lord Tokiyuki.</i></b>

09:03.460 --> 09:05.080
<b>-Lord Tokiyuki.
-Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

09:05.170 --> 09:06.670
<b>-<i>Lord Tokiyuki.
 </i>-Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

09:06.750 --> 09:08.630
<b>Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

09:09.670 --> 09:12.630
<b>Did my holy light bring you to your senses?</b>

09:12.710 --> 09:15.260
<b>Why do you keep shining at random times?</b>

09:16.720 --> 09:17.760
<b>I can see it.</b>

09:18.390 --> 09:21.310
<b>I can see a future where Muneshige 
Godaiin is sitting down.</b>

09:22.560 --> 09:26.100
<b>You know how I told you I can see 
the future with my holy power?</b>

09:26.730 --> 09:28.360
<b>Yeah, a rough vision on rare occasions.</b>

09:28.440 --> 09:34.690
<b>HERE WE GO
 GODAIIN - DUMB - ENEMIES</b>

09:29.690 --> 09:33.190
<b><i>There's a lot of enemy soldiers 
around him, and he's well protected.</i></b>

09:33.940 --> 09:37.740
<b>Where is Uncle now?</b>

09:38.820 --> 09:40.410
<b>Are you curious?</b>

09:44.370 --> 09:45.620
<b>Yes.</b>

09:52.210 --> 09:53.670
<b>In that case…</b>

09:58.890 --> 10:00.180
<b>let's go see.</b>

10:05.890 --> 10:09.980
<b>I'll show you what it means 
to win at a game of tag!</b>

10:10.060 --> 10:11.940
<b>Consider avenging your brother…</b>

10:13.530 --> 10:16.860
<b>your first step to reclaiming your country!</b>

10:20.410 --> 10:21.410
<b>Damn it!</b>

10:21.490 --> 10:23.910
<b>Why do you cast me aside?</b>

10:24.410 --> 10:26.790
<b>Don't you know I'm a man 
of great military success?</b>

10:27.290 --> 10:29.040
<b>He was a Hojo child!</b>

10:29.620 --> 10:34.050
<b><i>Is it because he was the 
child of a concubine?</i></b>

10:34.130 --> 10:38.430
<b><i>The head of a concubine's 
child is of no worth to you?</i></b>

10:39.220 --> 10:43.890
<b><i>If killing Kunitoki isn't enough 
in my life's game of dice,</i></b>

10:43.970 --> 10:45.720
<b><i>I need to roll higher numbers.</i></b>

10:46.390 --> 10:50.560
<b><i>In that case, maybe I should 
aim for the rightful heir!</i></b>

10:51.350 --> 10:53.270
<b><i>I can do it.</i></b>

10:54.440 --> 10:58.650
<b><i>If I capture Tokiyuki, the true 
heir, and present him to them,</i></b>

10:59.780 --> 11:04.080
<b><i>everyone will have no choice 
but to recognize me!</i></b>

11:05.330 --> 11:08.870
<b>His demonic behavior drove his friends away.</b>

11:08.960 --> 11:10.670
<b>Seems like he's lost everything.</b>

11:11.370 --> 11:13.460
<b>This greedy brute has turned into a demon</b>

11:13.540 --> 11:15.590
<b>who will chase you to the ends of the earth.</b>

11:15.670 --> 11:17.840
<b>Tokiyuki.</b>

11:17.920 --> 11:20.970
<b>Don't think you can outrun me.</b>

11:21.050 --> 11:25.260
<b>The first sure way to win at the 
game of tag is to know your enemy.</b>

11:26.100 --> 11:28.100
<b>Let's go back to the hideout, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

11:28.180 --> 11:29.100
<b>Huh?</b>

11:29.180 --> 11:31.770
<b>I will bestow upon you the 
second sure way to win.</b>

11:33.100 --> 11:35.270
<b>They should be arriving soon.</b>

11:35.360 --> 11:36.690
<b>Right, Father.</b>

11:38.320 --> 11:42.280
<b>It's become easier to win now that we 
know what our enemy looks like, right?</b>

11:44.240 --> 11:46.280
<b>Do you not have confidence?</b>

11:48.950 --> 11:53.080
<b>I never took my martial 
arts training seriously.</b>

11:53.170 --> 11:59.510
<b>No worries. I have some friends 
I want to introduce to you.</b>

12:00.130 --> 12:02.510
<b>They will become your arms and legs.</b>

12:02.590 --> 12:06.970
<b>They will help you greatly 
on the battlefield.</b>

12:09.100 --> 12:10.850
<b>KAZUSA PROVINCE - SHIMOSA 
PROVINCE - MUSASHI PROVINCE</b>

12:09.590 --> 12:14.480
<b>All right, I'm gonna buy all of Shimosa's 
bean fields, getting double the revenue!</b>

12:14.560 --> 12:17.190
<b>Hey, don't pass the God of Poverty to me!</b>

12:17.270 --> 12:19.860
<b>He's about to become the 
Emperor God of Poverty too.</b>

12:19.940 --> 12:22.200
<b>I don't think they're 
going to be very helpful.</b>

12:22.280 --> 12:24.780
<b>And isn't that a game of 
dice from a distant future?</b>

12:25.450 --> 12:27.120
<b>PRODUCER</b>

12:27.780 --> 12:29.330
<b>Hi. It's nice to meet ya, young lord!</b>

12:29.410 --> 12:31.790
<b>My name is Kojiro Nezu. It's a pleasure!</b>

12:32.290 --> 12:35.000
<b>I'm Ayako Mochizuki. Nice 
to meet you, my lord.</b>

12:35.710 --> 12:38.750
<b>They are the children of the 
Nezu and Mochizuki families,</b>

12:38.840 --> 12:40.260
<b>two families who serve the Suwa family.</b>

12:40.840 --> 12:42.590
<b>And because they serve the Suwa family,</b>

12:42.670 --> 12:46.010
<b>they ultimately serve the 
Hojo family above them.</b>

12:46.090 --> 12:50.890
<b>And though both of them are your age, Lord 
Tokiyuki, they excel in martial arts.</b>

12:50.970 --> 12:55.310
<b>So please rely on them to avenge our enemy.</b>

12:55.400 --> 12:59.150
<b>I'm Tokiyuki Hojo. Nice to meet you.</b>

12:59.230 --> 13:00.320
<b>-Sir!
-Sir!</b>

13:01.480 --> 13:03.650
<b><i>What did you think of Lord Tokiyuki?</i></b>

13:04.240 --> 13:05.820
<b>He's so cute!</b>

13:05.910 --> 13:07.570
<b>I just wanna carry him around.</b>

13:08.160 --> 13:10.200
<b>He's definitely not strong.</b>

13:10.290 --> 13:13.200
<b>And it's a strange proposition 
coming from Lord Yorishige</b>

13:13.290 --> 13:15.710
<b>to serve someone whose family 
has just been annihilated.</b>

13:15.790 --> 13:18.210
<b>If he's not strong, we have to protect him.</b>

13:23.970 --> 13:25.050
<b>Right.</b>

13:38.100 --> 13:43.570
<b>Now, Lord Tokiyuki, shall we take 
on the demon that's after us?</b>

14:05.840 --> 14:07.090
<b>He's coming.</b>

14:26.030 --> 14:29.950
<b><i>Oh, you look delectable.</i></b>

14:30.910 --> 14:33.240
<b>Uncle Godaiin?</b>

14:34.950 --> 14:37.000
<b>Oh, Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

14:37.080 --> 14:40.500
<b>If it isn't my lord!</b>

14:40.580 --> 14:43.380
<b>Oh, I'm so glad you're safe.</b>

14:43.460 --> 14:46.420
<b>Lord Yorishige said he would 
bring you to safety around Suwa,</b>

14:46.510 --> 14:47.630
<b>so I thought you'd be here.</b>

14:48.470 --> 14:49.550
<b>Are you alone?</b>

14:49.630 --> 14:53.640
<b>Don't worry, your old Uncle 
Muneshige's here for you.</b>

14:54.350 --> 14:55.890
<b>Let's run away together.</b>

14:56.730 --> 14:57.980
<b>Uncle.</b>

14:58.060 --> 14:59.270
<b>Yes?</b>

14:59.350 --> 15:02.190
<b>Why did you betray my brother?</b>

15:02.980 --> 15:03.860
<b>Huh?</b>

15:07.940 --> 15:10.200
<b>I see, I see.</b>

15:11.780 --> 15:13.160
<b>-We almost had him!
-My lord!</b>

15:14.370 --> 15:17.790
<b>So you anticipated I would 
come looking for you,</b>

15:17.870 --> 15:21.710
<b>and hid some friends to ambush 
me to avenge your brother.</b>

15:21.790 --> 15:25.380
<b>You poised yourself as if you trusted 
me. It was quite impressive.</b>

15:25.460 --> 15:27.840
<b>To think a child could be so conniving!</b>

15:28.470 --> 15:33.970
<b>But you see, Lord Tokiyuki, the reason 
I was entrusted to guard Kunitoki</b>

15:34.050 --> 15:37.470
<b>was not only because I am his 
uncle and an important retainer!</b>

15:38.060 --> 15:44.150
<b>I was appointed his guard because I'm strong.</b>

15:45.860 --> 15:50.610
<b>Kill two brats, chop off 
your legs, and sell you out.</b>

15:50.700 --> 15:53.490
<b>That's how I'll win my game of dice!</b>

15:53.570 --> 15:55.160
<b><i>The dice are cast.</i></b>

15:55.240 --> 15:57.160
<b><i>Is it a battle or just a game?</i></b>

15:57.240 --> 16:01.460
<b><i>It's a turbulent world of 
tag with our lives at stake.</i></b>

16:02.710 --> 16:05.090
<b><i>This is the first roll!</i></b>

16:05.170 --> 16:06.460
<b>DEMON OF DICE MUNESHIGE GODAIIN</b>

16:08.760 --> 16:11.340
<b>What happened, Lord Tokiyuki?</b>

16:11.420 --> 16:14.430
<b>This is your chance to avenge your brother!</b>

16:14.510 --> 16:17.390
<b>Get off my lord, scumbag!</b>

16:19.680 --> 16:21.350
<b>You're in my way!</b>

16:26.360 --> 16:27.480
<b>-Hey!
-Damn it.</b>

16:27.570 --> 16:29.820
<b>Take this! Take that!</b>

16:29.900 --> 16:31.650
<b>My lord, get behind me!</b>

16:31.740 --> 16:34.410
<b><i>I have no openings. And what mighty strength!</i></b>

16:34.490 --> 16:36.870
<b><i>I can't do anything while I protect 
myself and the Young Lord.</i></b>

16:37.700 --> 16:40.250
<b><i>What am I supposed to do 
after this, Mr. Yorishige?</i></b>

16:40.830 --> 16:42.660
<b><i>After all, we're just kids 
going up against a grown man.</i></b>

16:42.750 --> 16:45.630
<b><i>If our surprise attack 
fails, we stand no chance.</i></b>

16:48.550 --> 16:51.300
<b><i>It's just some kiddy sneak attack 
with just the three of them.</i></b>

16:51.880 --> 16:53.880
<b>This is nothing!</b>

16:53.970 --> 16:57.180
<b>I'm quick to adapt to situations. 
That's one of my strengths.</b>

16:57.260 --> 17:00.810
<b>I'd betray even my lord's child 
if it meant saving my own life!</b>

17:00.890 --> 17:03.270
<b>Don't make it hard for me, Tokiyuki.</b>

17:03.350 --> 17:07.020
<b>Your brother didn't even put up a fight!</b>

17:08.940 --> 17:13.570
<b><i>Ashikaga overthrew the Shogunate, 
and then came tumultuous times.</i></b>

17:18.870 --> 17:21.620
<b><i>When the board to the game 
of dice has been flipped,</i></b>

17:22.620 --> 17:26.290
<b><i>only those who can instantly 
adapt can survive!</i></b>

17:26.370 --> 17:27.380
<b>Hmm?</b>

17:34.550 --> 17:36.470
<b>Tokiyuki!</b>

17:37.050 --> 17:41.060
<b>Tokiyuki, Tokiyuki, Tokiyuki, Tokiyuki!</b>

17:41.890 --> 17:45.270
<b>You're a relic of a bygone era.</b>

17:45.850 --> 17:49.020
<b>Accept your fate, and 
fuel my rise to the top!</b>

17:54.070 --> 17:55.070
<b>My lord!</b>

17:55.650 --> 17:58.450
<b>Kojiro, Ayako, retreat!</b>

17:58.530 --> 17:59.780
<b>-Huh?
-Why?</b>

17:59.870 --> 18:01.660
<b>Just listen to me and get back.</b>

18:02.160 --> 18:05.410
<b>You two should take a good 
look at this Young Lord.</b>

18:05.500 --> 18:09.250
<b>See who is more adaptable 
to tumultuous times.</b>

18:17.130 --> 18:19.010
<b>That's impressive, my lord.</b>

18:19.090 --> 18:21.850
<b>He's seeing through all those swift swings.</b>

18:25.310 --> 18:28.310
<b>And it looks like he's enjoying it.</b>

18:34.820 --> 18:37.110
<b>Those aren't moves you learn by training.</b>

18:37.780 --> 18:39.160
<b>His elusiveness…</b>

18:41.950 --> 18:43.280
<b>It's heaven-sent!</b>

18:45.080 --> 18:47.290
<b>Lord Tokiyuki isn't a coward.</b>

18:48.290 --> 18:50.670
<b>He genuinely enjoys the chase.</b>

18:52.290 --> 18:54.500
<b><i>One misstep would be fatal.</i></b>

18:54.590 --> 18:55.920
<b><i>Capture would be instant death.</i></b>

18:56.010 --> 18:57.920
<b><i>His survival instinct is monstrous,</i></b>

18:58.010 --> 19:00.720
<b><i>which means his very soul 
can find joy in such crisis.</i></b>

19:01.510 --> 19:05.640
<b><i>Before the war, back when 
Kamakura was peaceful,</i></b>

19:05.720 --> 19:08.890
<b><i>the boy was amiable, modest, 
kind-hearted, and considerate.</i></b>

19:08.980 --> 19:10.400
<b><i>He hated conflict,</i></b>

19:10.480 --> 19:13.900
<b><i>and his habit of running away from his 
much-despised training was a shortcoming.</i></b>

19:13.980 --> 19:16.530
<b><i>He was an ordinary kid like any other.</i></b>

19:16.610 --> 19:21.240
<b><i>But on the battlefield, he 
becomes a gleeful monster,</i></b>

19:21.320 --> 19:23.950
<b><i>happily playing tag against 
the fiercest of the fierce.</i></b>

19:25.040 --> 19:31.290
<b>Shizuku, Kojiro, Ayako, don't you think 
it'll be fun to serve a master like that?</b>

19:31.370 --> 19:35.300
<b>A general who's known for running 
away? I've never heard of that.</b>

19:35.380 --> 19:39.170
<b>But when you say it like that, Lord 
Yorishige, I guess it does sound fun.</b>

19:39.260 --> 19:41.680
<b>I just want to be his friend!</b>

19:41.760 --> 19:42.890
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

19:44.260 --> 19:45.390
<b>All right, now.</b>

19:45.470 --> 19:48.100
<b>-Go give this another chance!
-Yes, sir!</b>

19:48.680 --> 19:50.440
<b><i>You mustn't try to protect him.</i></b>

19:50.520 --> 19:52.810
<b><i>You have to trust his elusiveness.</i></b>

19:52.900 --> 19:54.310
<b><i>The trade-off…</i></b>

19:54.400 --> 19:55.400
<b>SLUGGISH</b>

19:55.480 --> 19:58.940
<b>-<i>…is his attacks are very 
weak. </i>-You little brat!</b>

20:00.070 --> 20:03.030
<b><i>Go create an opening for him to attack.</i></b>

20:07.240 --> 20:12.460
<b><i>If he's set on killing me by evading forever,</i></b>

20:13.040 --> 20:14.040
<b><i>then sooner or later…</i></b>

20:19.630 --> 20:21.550
<b>-You guys!
-Time for offense!</b>

20:25.220 --> 20:27.850
<b><i>My job isn't to protect the 
Young Lord from the enemy.</i></b>

20:28.350 --> 20:30.480
<b>Tokiyuki!</b>

20:32.310 --> 20:33.310
<b>Whoa.</b>

20:35.190 --> 20:36.770
<b>You bastards!</b>

20:40.320 --> 20:43.950
<b><i>Try to offer up the enemy 
while the Young Lord evades.</i></b>

20:44.030 --> 20:45.990
<b>Now, my lord!</b>

20:50.750 --> 20:54.620
<b><i>Brother, Father, citizens of Kamakura,</i></b>

20:55.210 --> 20:57.130
<b><i>this head isn't enough to avenge you.</i></b>

20:57.210 --> 20:58.710
<b><i>But at least…</i></b>

21:05.890 --> 21:07.350
<b><i>it'll make for a souvenir</i></b>

21:08.510 --> 21:10.350
<b><i>as you walk your path to the other side!</i></b>

21:19.020 --> 21:20.030
<b>Huh?</b>

21:21.030 --> 21:22.900
<b>Where did it come from?</b>

21:23.650 --> 21:25.950
<b>I'm not going to be a hero.</b>

21:26.030 --> 21:28.240
<b>Even you're laughing at me.</b>

21:28.320 --> 21:31.700
<b>It's not that I'm making fun of you.</b>

21:31.790 --> 21:35.620
<b>Let's get inside already. 
I wonder what's for dinner.</b>

21:37.790 --> 21:40.090
<b>Oh, Tokiyuki!</b>

21:41.880 --> 21:42.880
<b>You can do it!</b>

21:44.260 --> 21:47.140
<b>If you try.</b>

21:48.090 --> 21:49.430
<b>What was that?</b>

21:50.010 --> 21:52.810
<b>You kinda sound like a fraud shaman.</b>

21:52.890 --> 21:54.640
<b>Huh? Really?</b>

21:54.730 --> 21:55.980
<b>It's not a compliment.</b>

21:57.810 --> 21:59.440
<b>I wonder what's for dinner.</b>

21:59.520 --> 22:01.020
<b>I'm hungry for sea bream.</b>

22:01.110 --> 22:03.070
<b>Oh, that sounds good!</b>

23:39.040 --> 23:39.960
<b>EPISODE 3 (YEAR OF 1333):
 A FOREST INHABITED BY A GOD</b>

23:39.040 --> 23:39.960
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>
